Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [Fix] [NVIDIA] deepseek-v4.1: Fix the breakable prefill
 CUDA graph in the late-layer tail on SM90

Without the in-graph low-ratio path (SM90), the late-layer tail of decoder SWA
bounded replay broke the breakable prefill graph twice: the tail's eager
low-ratio break rebuilt its rows from the whole extend's extend_seq_lens
(repeat_interleave assert during warmup), and the source-layer KV write at the
start of the tail was captured with the capture-time row count (assert on
replay). Take the live prefix of the hoisted rows in that break, and run the
source-layer KV write as an eager break over the live rows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../layers/attention/deepseek_v4_backend.py   | 10 ++++
 python/sglang/srt/models/deepseek_v4.py       | 49 ++++++++++++++---
 .../unittests/dsv4/test_deepseek_v4.py        | 53 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 106 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/deepseek_v4_backend.py b/python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/deepseek_v4_backend.py
index da5596206c2b..6d8531d90398 100644
--- a/python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/deepseek_v4_backend.py
+++ b/python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/deepseek_v4_backend.py
@@ -3251,6 +3251,16 @@ def forward_low_ratio_sources(
             # Bucket-sized under the prefill graph; an eager break sees the
             # live rows only and falls through.
             req, pos = hoisted_req, hoisted_pos
+        elif (
+            hoisted_req is not None
+            and hoisted_pos is not None
+            and forward_batch.forward_mode.is_extend()
+            and hoisted_pos.shape[0] > positions.shape[0]
+        ):
+            # An eager break in the late-layer tail sees only the tail's live rows,
+            # while extend_seq_lens still spans the whole extend; live rows come first.
+            n = positions.shape[0]
+            req, pos = hoisted_req[:n], hoisted_pos[:n]
         else:
             req = token_req_indices(forward_batch, num_tokens=positions.shape[0])
             pos = positions
diff --git a/python/sglang/srt/models/deepseek_v4.py b/python/sglang/srt/models/deepseek_v4.py
