Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Test the late-layer tail source-KV eager break

Cover deepseek_v4_write_tail_source_kv: it writes only the extend's live rows,
and with no live rows it skips the write but still marks the source layer, as
write_tail_source_kv does, so the layer's own pass inside the tail skips its
compressor. Comment the zero-row branch accordingly.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 python/sglang/srt/models/deepseek_v4.py       |  2 +
 .../unittests/dsv4/test_deepseek_v4.py        | 39 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 41 insertions(+)

